"description": "Teleflex, Inc. engages in the provision of medical technology products. It operates through the following business segments: Americas, EMEA (Europe, the Middle East and Africa), Asia Pacific. The Americas, EMEA, and Asia Pacific segments are involved in the design, manufacture, and distribution of medical devices primarily used in critical care and surgical applications and generally serve two end-markets: hospitals and healthcare providers, and home health. The company was founded in 1943 and is headquartered in Wayne, PA.",
